data: {"id": "778b7cab60ca41cf-thinking-parallel_evidence-1446", "run_id": "778b7cab60ca41cf", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 状态确认**：`aiops-case-v14/workload` 仍为 `Pending`，容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting`，`Reason: ContainerCreating`。这与上游 `ContainerCreating` 判断一致。\n2. **Events 关键事实**：kubelet 在 42 分钟前记录了 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 事件，原文：\n   ```\n   failed to setup network for sandbox ...: plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add):\n   [aiops-case-v14/workload:secondary-net]: error adding container to network \"secondary-net\":\n   failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789376047270, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "778b7cab60ca41cf-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "778b7cab60ca41cf", "seq": 1447, "ts_ms": 1789376056425, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 34.75, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v14", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/778b7cab60ca41cf-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "cc91677a004e9a1c4253082535c6eef83e54d4733ff7e27634ff87cd308003ee", "bytes": 2569}, "snapshot_sha256": "ab31290efeb93a7704b240be1ffb1ba0c49a66bbf2d6d238413cf5cd506367bb"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "778b7cab60ca41cf-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "778b7cab60ca41cf", "seq": 1448, "ts_ms": 1789376056426, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "778b7cab60ca41cf-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "778b7cab60ca41cf", "seq": 1449, "ts_ms": 1789376067394, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 10.968, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 2014, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v14/workload` | ContainerCreating | aiops-case-v14/workload pod stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state due to network setup failure. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `failed to setup network for sandbox \"a2dd4c27...\": plugin type=\"multus\" ... failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin]` | 明确根因：多租户插件二进制文件丢失导致沙箱创建失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: secondary-net` | 提供触发上下文：Pod 尝试挂载名为 `secondary-net` 的网络 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason[reason=\"ContainerCreating\"]` = `1` | 确认容器状态停留在创建前阶段，与 CNI 插件失败现象一致 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = `0` | 排除因应用层异常导致重启的可能性 |\n| 5 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status`: `Pending` | 确认 Pod 因网络依赖未满足而无法进入运行态 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n- **K8s Event (fact-f52f6611194e)** 给出了确切的失败原因：`aiops-unavailable` 插件缺失。这与 **K8s Config (fact-54e7aeab1c25)** 中定义的 `secondary-net` 网络配置直接关联。\n- **Metric (fact-b3c143a0180a, fact-a49431b3bf2b)** 确认了 Pod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态且重启数为 0，从侧面证实了故障发生在启动初期，而非应用运行时。\n- **Logging/Tracing** 因 Pod 无法启动且无 Pod IP 被判定为不可用，缺乏数据支持，但这符合预期的故障传播路径（CNI 失败 -> Pod Pending -> 无日志/Trace）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nCNI 插件二进制文件 'aiops-unavailable' 从节点路径缺失 → Multus 在挂载 secondary-net 时无法加载指定插件导致网络初始化失败 → kubelet 创建 Pod 沙箱（FailedCreatePodSandBox） → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态，无法启动应用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\n集群节点 `/opt/cni/bin` 路径下缺失由 `aiops-unavailable` 插件所需的 CNI 二进制文件（引用 **证据 #1**）。由于 Pod `aiops-case-v14/workload` 配置了依赖 Multus 和该插件的 `secondary-net` 网络（引用 **证据 #2**），导致 `kubelet` 在创建 Pod 沙箱时网络设置步骤失败。这直接导致了 Pod 持续处于 `Pending/ContainerCreating` 状态（引用 **证据 #5**），且 `ContainerCreating` 等待指标为 1（引用 **证据 #3**）。\n\n**未确认事项：**\n- 导致 `aiops-unavailable` 插件缺失的具体系统原因（例如：安装脚本未执行、DaemonSet 故障或文件被误删）。\n- `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 中引用的插件名称是否准确。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v14/workload` | ContainerCreating | aiops-case-v14/workload pod stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state due to network setup failure. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `failed to setup network for sandbox \"a2dd4c27...\": plugin type=\"multus\" ... failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin]` | 明确根因：多租户插件二进制文件丢失导致沙箱创建失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: secondary-net` | 提供触发上下文：Pod 尝试挂载名为 `secondary-net` 的网络 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason[reason=\"ContainerCreating\"]` = `1` | 确认容器状态停留在创建前阶段，与 CNI 插件失败现象一致 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = `0` | 排除因应用层异常导致重启的可能性 |\n| 5 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status`: `Pending` | 确认 Pod 因网络依赖未满足而无法进入运行态 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n- **K8s Event (fact-f52f6611194e)** 给出了确切的失败原因：`aiops-unavailable` 插件缺失。这与 **K8s Config (fact-54e7aeab1c25)** 中定义的 `secondary-net` 网络配置直接关联。\n- **Metric (fact-b3c143a0180a, fact-a49431b3bf2b)** 确认了 Pod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态且重启数为 0，从侧面证实了故障发生在启动初期，而非应用运行时。\n- **Logging/Tracing** 因 Pod 无法启动且无 Pod IP 被判定为不可用，缺乏数据支持，但这符合预期的故障传播路径（CNI 失败 -> Pod Pending -> 无日志/Trace）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nCNI 插件二进制文件 'aiops-unavailable' 从节点路径缺失 → Multus 在挂载 secondary-net 时无法加载指定插件导致网络初始化失败 → kubelet 创建 Pod 沙箱（FailedCreatePodSandBox） → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态，无法启动应用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\n集群节点 `/opt/cni/bin` 路径下缺失由 `aiops-unavailable` 插件所需的 CNI 二进制文件（引用 **证据 #1**）。由于 Pod `aiops-case-v14/workload` 配置了依赖 Multus 和该插件的 `secondary-net` 网络（引用 **证据 #2**），导致 `kubelet` 在创建 Pod 沙箱时网络设置步骤失败。这直接导致了 Pod 持续处于 `Pending/ContainerCreating` 状态（引用 **证据 #5**），且 `ContainerCreating` 等待指标为 1（引用 **证据 #3**）。\n\n**未确认事项：**\n- 导致 `aiops-unavailable` 插件缺失的具体系统原因（例如：安装脚本未执行、DaemonSet 故障或文件被误删）。\n- `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 中引用的插件名称是否准确。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "778b7cab60ca41cf-final", "run_id": "778b7cab60ca41cf", "seq": 1451, "ts_ms": 1789376067415, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v14/workload` | ContainerCreating | aiops-case-v14/workload pod stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state due to network setup failure. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `failed to setup network for sandbox \"a2dd4c27...\": plugin type=\"multus\" ... failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin]` | 明确根因：多租户插件二进制文件丢失导致沙箱创建失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: secondary-net` | 提供触发上下文：Pod 尝试挂载名为 `secondary-net` 的网络 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason[reason=\"ContainerCreating\"]` = `1` | 确认容器状态停留在创建前阶段，与 CNI 插件失败现象一致 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = `0` | 排除因应用层异常导致重启的可能性 |\n| 5 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status`: `Pending` | 确认 Pod 因网络依赖未满足而无法进入运行态 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n- **K8s Event (fact-f52f6611194e)** 给出了确切的失败原因：`aiops-unavailable` 插件缺失。这与 **K8s Config (fact-54e7aeab1c25)** 中定义的 `secondary-net` 网络配置直接关联。\n- **Metric (fact-b3c143a0180a, fact-a49431b3bf2b)** 确认了 Pod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态且重启数为 0，从侧面证实了故障发生在启动初期，而非应用运行时。\n- **Logging/Tracing** 因 Pod 无法启动且无 Pod IP 被判定为不可用，缺乏数据支持，但这符合预期的故障传播路径（CNI 失败 -> Pod Pending -> 无日志/Trace）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nCNI 插件二进制文件 'aiops-unavailable' 从节点路径缺失 → Multus 在挂载 secondary-net 时无法加载指定插件导致网络初始化失败 → kubelet 创建 Pod 沙箱（FailedCreatePodSandBox） → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态，无法启动应用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\n集群节点 `/opt/cni/bin` 路径下缺失由 `aiops-unavailable` 插件所需的 CNI 二进制文件（引用 **证据 #1**）。由于 Pod `aiops-case-v14/workload` 配置了依赖 Multus 和该插件的 `secondary-net` 网络（引用 **证据 #2**），导致 `kubelet` 在创建 Pod 沙箱时网络设置步骤失败。这直接导致了 Pod 持续处于 `Pending/ContainerCreating` 状态（引用 **证据 #5**），且 `ContainerCreating` 等待指标为 1（引用 **证据 #3**）。\n\n**未确认事项：**\n- 导致 `aiops-unavailable` 插件缺失的具体系统原因（例如：安装脚本未执行、DaemonSet 故障或文件被误删）。\n- `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 中引用的插件名称是否准确。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 34.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v14/workload: 34.7s (Evidence 25.6s, RCA 9.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v14/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 67.306, "metrics": {"run_id": "778b7cab60ca41cf", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 67.30661797523499, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown":